creatures:
- name: Efreeti
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 212 (rollable(dice=17d10 + 119,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 60 ft. (hover)  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=22)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=24)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Damage Immunities** fire  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Primordial (Ignan)  
      **Challenge** 11 (7,200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Traits

      ***Elemental Restoration.*** If the efreeti dies outside the Elemental Plane of Fire, its body dissolves into ash, and it gains a new body in rollable(dice=1d4,dicelabel=Elemental Restoration) days, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** somewhere on the Plane of Fire.

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The efreeti has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ***Wishes.*** The efreeti has a 30 percent chance of knowing the [Wish](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619213-wish) spell. If the efreeti knows it, the efreeti can cast it only on behalf of a non-genie creature who communicates a wish in a way the efreeti can understand. If the efreeti casts the spell for the creature, the efreeti suffers none of the spell's stress. Once the efreeti has cast it three times, the efreeti can't do so again for 365 days.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The efreeti makes three attacks, using Heated Blade or Hurl Flame in any combination.

      ***Heated Blade.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=To Hit [Heated Blade]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+6,dicelabel=Damage [Heated Blade]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d12,dicelabel=Damage [Heated Blade]) Fire damage.

      ***Hurl Flame.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Hurl Flame]), range 120 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=7d6,dicelabel=Damage [Hurl Flame]) Fire damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The efreeti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 16):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Elementalism](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618834-elementalism)  
      1/day each: [Gaseous Form](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618927-gaseous-form), [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility), [Major Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619025-major-image), [Plane Shift](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618867-plane-shift), [Tongues](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619190-tongues), [Wall of Fire](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619107-wall-of-fire) (level 7 version)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Elemental (Genie), Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 11
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024efreeti
  status: 1

